[31.911055, "o", "> "]
[31.911377, "o", "2. **Parse and Format Dates**: Convert the '\"'\"'last_login'\"'\"' ISO 8601 timestamp into a date string in the format '\"'\"'YYYY-MM-DD'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[31.911446, "o", "3. **Extract and Rename Fields**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[31.911495, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[31.911602, "o", "   - Extract '\"'\"'id'\"'\"' as '\"'\"'user_id'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rm '\"'"]
[31.911684, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>    - Extract '\"'\"'username'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rnput\r\n    \"r"]
[31.911692, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[31.911777, "o", "   - Extract '\"'\"'email'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[31.911877, "o", "   - Extract and format '\"'\"'last_login'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[31.911932, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
