[31.912123, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[31.91232, "o", "   - Extract the first role from the '\"'\"'roles'\"'\"' array as '\"'\"'primary_role'\"'\"' (if roles exist, otherwise null).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[31.912563, "o", "4. **Sort Users**: Sort the resulting users alphabetically by their '\"'\"'username'\"'\"' in ascending order.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[31.912582, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[31.912591, "o", "> "]
[31.91282, "o", "5. **Output Format**: The output must be a JSON array of objects formatted with indentation of 2 spaces.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
